<DocsLayout title="Export Formats" description="Every format Ravenburst exports to — manuscripts, paperback interiors, e-books, scripts, academic papers and picture books — and what each looks like.">
  <h1>Export Formats</h1>
  <p class="lede">All formats are in <span class="menu">File → Compile / Export…</span>. This page describes what each one produces. For choosing what's included, see <a href="/docs/compile-options">Compiling</a>.</p>

